{"cv":[{"lang":"협업","names":["Vlado Stokanic"]}],"lines":[{"t":"Appointed as Assistant","x":"If you invited me, you must not be looking for a tactician.","u":null,"p":"HOME_PLACE"},{"t":"Talk 1","x":"I love my country, for better or for worse.","u":null,"p":"HOME_SHOW"},{"t":"Talk 2","x":"Have you met my sister? She's the one in the white coat in the photo, and those are her children.","u":null,"p":"HOME_SHOW"},{"t":"Talk 3","x":"Survive. Be a leader. You don't want your loved ones crying over your grave, do you?","u":null,"p":"HOME_SHOW"},{"t":"Talk after Promotion 1","x":"I don't want my kids to follow in my footsteps. Being a soldier is too dangerous.","u":{"type":"AWAKE","param":"1"},"p":"HOME_SHOW"},{"t":"Talk after Promotion 2","x":"In my country, focusing firepower on a target is considered a simple and effective way to achieve victory.","u":{"type":"AWAKE","param":"2"},"p":"HOME_SHOW"},{"t":"Talk after Trust Increase 1","x":"I like the way you think.","u":{"type":"FAVOR","param":"40"},"p":"HOME_SHOW"},{"t":"Talk after Trust Increase 2","x":"Personally, I prefer the enemies come to us in search of death. How about you?","u":{"type":"FAVOR","param":"100"},"p":"HOME_SHOW"},{"t":"Talk after Trust Increase 3","x":"Relax, baby. When this is all over, I'll buy you some vodka.","u":{"type":"FAVOR","param":"200"},"p":"HOME_SHOW"},{"t":"Idle","x":"Are you bored? Why not clean your weapon?","u":null,"p":"HOME_WAIT"},{"t":"Onboard","x":"RAINBOW Operator, codename Tachanka. I'm ready. Where do you want me?","u":null,"p":"GACHA"},{"t":"Watching Battle Record","x":"First, we learn about them. Then we outsmart them.","u":null,"p":"LEVEL_UP"},{"t":"Promotion 1","x":"Good.","u":{"type":"AWAKE","param":"1"},"p":"EVOLVE_ONE"},{"t":"Promotion 2","x":"They told me I'd died. They were wrong. I was reborn.","u":{"type":"AWAKE","param":"2"},"p":"EVOLVE_TWO"},{"t":"Added to Squad","x":"Yes, yes. I know.","u":null,"p":"SQUAD"},{"t":"Appointed as Squad Leader","x":"Just don't play hero, it never works.","u":null,"p":"SQUAD_FIRST"},{"t":"Depart","x":"Stay right with me!","u":null,"p":"BATTLE_START"},{"t":"Begin Operation","x":"Hostiles in sight.","u":null,"p":"BATTLE_FACE_ENEMY"},{"t":"Selecting Operator 1","x":"Oh, yes. Baby.","u":null,"p":"BATTLE_SELECT"},{"t":"Selecting Operator 2","x":"Let's get to work.","u":null,"p":"BATTLE_SELECT"},{"t":"Deployment 1","x":"Guys, you are all lucky I was there.","u":null,"p":"BATTLE_PLACE"},{"t":"Deployment 2","x":"Don't worry! Tachanka is here!","u":null,"p":"BATTLE_PLACE"},{"t":"In Battle 1","x":"Come to Tachanka, baby.","u":null,"p":"BATTLE_SKILL_1"},{"t":"In Battle 2","x":"Time to get serious.","u":null,"p":"BATTLE_SKILL_2"},{"t":"In Battle 3","x":"Killing zone deployed.","u":null,"p":"BATTLE_SKILL_3"},{"t":"In Battle 4","x":"Let them come!","u":null,"p":"BATTLE_SKILL_4"},{"t":"4-star Result","x":"That was unexpected.","u":null,"p":"FOUR_STAR"},{"t":"3-star Result","x":"I've seen it all.","u":null,"p":"THREE_STAR"},{"t":"Sub 3-star Result","x":"We're not out of the woods, bratan.","u":null,"p":"TWO_STAR"},{"t":"Operation Failure","x":"Protect the doctor!","u":null,"p":"LOSE"},{"t":"Assigned to Facility","x":"Not a problem.","u":null,"p":"BUILDING_PLACE"},{"t":"Tap","x":"Be careful, comrade.","u":null,"p":"BUILDING_TOUCHING"},{"t":"Trust Tap","x":"Call me in for support if you need it.","u":null,"p":"BUILDING_FAVOR_BUBBLE"},{"t":"Title","x":"Arknights.","u":null,"p":"LOADING_PANEL"},{"t":"Greeting","x":"Excuse me?","u":null,"p":"GREETING"}]}